    "type": "automation",
    "notes": {
        "15b7469a-f5a0-5a81-a6a8-149f256c11f6": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": -32,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 192,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Timing — do not remove the Wait step\n\nThe Abandoned Cart trigger polls `/carts` and **baselines the existing carts on its first tick** — only carts that appear later are emitted. The `Wait 1m` step delays the cart creation until after that first tick; without it the provoking cart lands in the baseline and the flow times out.\n\nThe cart is created (POST `/carts`) and cleaned up (DELETE) by the flow itself, so no shop data is assumed."
        }
    },
